  "request": "Goal: Fix `senti workflow --help` in the owning `senti` CLI repository so it displays the workflow command help instead of plugin package help.\nScope: Adjust top-level help dispatch so plugin command help is reachable for `senti workflow --help`, while package-level workflow plugin help remains available through `senti help workflow`.\nEvidence: In `senti-workflow-plugin`, `commands/workflow.js` already returns the expected command-level help with add/update/show/search/list/publish/refine/ideas, but actual `senti workflow --help` returns `Plugin: workflow`. Spec review identified `/home/nakano/workspace/senti/src/senti.js` and `/home/nakano/workspace/senti/src/help.js` as the owning implementation path.\nOut of Scope: Updating stale `.senti/plugins/workflow` snapshots or changing workflow board service behavior.",
